      "message": "fix(examples): pin the catalog refusal.txt files to LF\n\nThe refusal test of example_catalog compares the refusal lines byte for\nbyte. No rule in .gitattributes covered refusal.txt, so a checkout with\ncore.autocrlf=true wrote CRLF and two tests failed on Windows.\n\nFixes #3628\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
